But if you don't have to like take the time to turn in addition to jumping, you can get

00:33:36.160 --> 00:33:37.400
out of any of those projectiles.

00:33:37.520 --> 00:33:38.660
Like it doesn't matter where the hell you are.

00:33:38.740 --> 00:33:40.600
