00:33:42.440 --> 00:33:47.540
It's, you know, because of it being slower, you have to kind of watch where the spread is

00:33:47.540 --> 00:33:49.980
going, whether it's from left to right or right to left.

00:33:50.140 --> 00:33:55.540
Like you have to kind of bait the octopus and then the hop, start hopping away in order

00:33:55.540 --> 00:34:00.700
