00:34:00.700 --> 00:34:02.360
swim up and approach you.

00:34:03.100 --> 00:34:05.080
In which case you can then attack.

00:34:05.280 --> 00:34:09.620
And there's, you know, just another fun example here is like the things you collect in dungeons

00:34:09.620 --> 00:34:11.400
are only good for that dungeon.

00:34:11.400 --> 00:34:16.240
