00:34:43.940 --> 00:34:46.680
can use your baseball bat to hit them like crazy.

00:34:46.920 --> 00:34:51.700
And this way you don't have to hit with the yo-yo like two or three times and then go back

00:34:51.700 --> 00:34:56.040
to the whole projectile spread attack and hope to bait him back in.

00:34:56.280 --> 00:35:05.520
The yo-yo is a fun weapon and a fun idea, but it is a very basic weapon with a very limited

00:35:05.520 --> 00:35:08.380
stretch. And I think you have it for way too long.

00:35:08.600 --> 00:35:10.080
